，詩人歌之。春秋采善貶惡，推三代之德，褒周室，非獨刺譏而已也。』漢興以來，至明天子，獲符瑞，封禪，改正朔，易服色，受命於穆清，澤流罔極，海外殊俗，重譯款塞，請來獻見者，不可勝道。臣下百官力誦聖德，猶不能宣盡其意。且士賢能而不用，有國者之恥；主上明聖而德不布聞，有司之過也。且余嘗掌其官，廢明聖盛德不載，滅功臣世家賢大夫之業不述，墮先人所言，罪莫大焉。余所謂述故事，整齊其世傳，非所謂作也，而君比之於春秋，謬矣。」","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"先人","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"伏羲","kind":"person","person_id":"0xr_z2z_lne","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"0ea_a78_okm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ab2_pxs_34r","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"湯武","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"明天子","kind":"person","person_id":"xqy_bvp_g1a","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong:m011-0218","start":218,"end":220,"surface":"先人","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","book_id":"b-shiji-130","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-130-taishigong","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-130","source_id":"s-shiji130-taishigong","source":{"title":"史記／卷130","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷130","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷130&oldid=2609362","revision_id":2609362,"accessed_on":"2026-10-11","extent":